Package: predicater
Title: Modern and consistent validation for R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Ricardo", "Semião", , "ricardo.semiao@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Validation of R objects with more consistency and flexibility
    than base 'is' functions, having predictable and well documented
    behavior. Provides simple 'is'/'are'/'has' predicates, and complex
    assertions for common input validation needs. Includes improved object
    comparison, prototypes, if-else chains, and pattern matching.
